Package: nlsxnetos
Version: 0.1.0
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: NlsxNetOS contributors
Depends: frr, frr-pythontools, iproute2, nftables, python3 (>= 3.10), python3-yaml, python3-cryptography, systemd | init-system-helpers
Description: NlsxNetOS Ubuntu network operating system toolkit
 NlsxNetOS provides Linux networking and FRRouting management, NLS cryptographic
 services, and Router-CA trust metadata. It does not own FRR files.
